notes:
Used mainly for floor space and land area in real estate. One {坪|つぼ} ≈ 3.3 m².

COUNTING PATTERNS:
- 1: {一坪|ひとつぼ}
- 2: {二坪|ふたつぼ}
- 3: {三坪|さんつぼ}
- 4: {四坪|よんつぼ}
- 5: {五坪|ごつぼ}
- 10: {十坪|じゅっつぼ}

The first three use native readings ({一|ひと}/{二|ふた}/⟦{三|さん}→三：00749_san⟧); from four up, the Sino-Japanese numbers are used. 8 and 10 commonly take a small っ ({八坪|はっつぼ}, {十坪|じゅっつぼ}).
